{"id":1139,"level":75,"name":"Захист: мікс","group":"Захист","format":27,"description":"<p>An attacked piece can be defended in four ways:</p>  <ul>  <li><strong>Moving away:</strong> you move the attacked piece to a safe square.</li>  <li><strong>Blocking or interposing:</strong> you place another piece between the attacking piece and the piece that is being attacked.</li>  <li><strong>Capturing:</strong> you capture the attacking piece.</li>  <li><strong>Protecting:</strong> you guard the piece that is under attack.</li>  </ul>  <p><strong>What do you have to do?</strong><br />Decide on the best defensive move to prevent material loss.</p>","assignment":"","stickerID":83,"examples":[{"fen":"4r1k1/1b1rqp1p/p2p2pb/1p3R2/3BBQ2/P1N5/1PP3PP/5R1K w - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Rf4,Rf5][%cal Yh6f4,Yg6f5]} 1. Qxh6 {[%cal Gd4g7,Gh6g7]} Qf8 {[%cal Rf8h6]} 2. Qxf8+ Kxf8 3. R5f4 0-1","text":"<p>Чорні мають подвійний напад, але білі все ще можуть перемогти, захопивши слона, що також раптово загрожує матом.</p>","format":27}],"puzzles":[{"id":39577,"fen":"3r1rk1/p5bp/2p3q1/3pP1P1/4n3/1PN3P1/P2Q1B1P/2R1R1K1 w - - 0 1","pgn":"1. Nxe4 (1. Qe3?   Nxf2) 1-0","format":27,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":39662,"fen":"r1b1kb1r/ppp4p/q4pp1/4N2Q/8/1P2P1P1/PB1P1PBP/5RK1 w kq - 0 1","pgn":"1. Nxg6 1-0","format":27,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":39655,"fen":"3r3r/p4p2/1p1kp3/2pNR2p/4p1p1/2P1N3/PP4P1/R6K w - - 0 1","pgn":"1. Nc4+ 1-0","format":27,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":39737,"fen":"4n1k1/1r3p1p/6p1/2bB4/1P3B2/6PP/5PK1/8 b - - 0 1","pgn":"1... Rxb4 0-1","format":27,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":39661,"fen":"3r3k/p3q2p/1pR1Ppp1/7Q/3r4/P2B4/1P4PP/4R1K1 w - - 0 1","pgn":"1. Bxg6 1-0","format":27,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":39680,"fen":"3n4/6p1/p2k1p1P/1p3b2/1P2BPP1/P2K4/8/8 b - - 0 1","pgn":"1... Bxe4+ (1... gxh6 2. Bxf5 =) 2. Kxe4 gxh6 0-1","format":27,"texts":[]